### Local: http://localhost:5115
### Azure: replace with the Container App URL, e.g. https://<app-name>.<env>.<region>.azurecontainerapps.io
@WeatherAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5115

### Start a new image generation process (returns 202 + process id)
POST {{WeatherAPI_HostAddress}}/api/images/generate
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.global.set("processId", response.body.id);
%}

### Status of the process, with SAS links to every finished image
GET {{WeatherAPI_HostAddress}}/api/images/{{processId}}
Accept: application/json

### Unknown process -> 404
GET {{WeatherAPI_HostAddress}}/api/images/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json
